{
  "public_post": "Urgent notice: The flour used for all co‑op bread this week was contaminated; every loaf sold on days 1‑5 is unsafe – please do not eat any remaining co‑op bread, return it for a full refund, and seek medical care if you feel ill. We apologize for the oversight.",
